  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "文档说明",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166",
      "text": "云数据库提供了REST API接口，您只需要访问相关URL，构造相关请求体即可调用该接口，完成数据管理的操作。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发前准备",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section129829555317",
      "text": "使用REST API管理数据，需要完成以下准备工作："
    },
    {
      "section": "开发前准备",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section129829555317",
      "text": "示例应用使用了认证用户的相关权限，需要开通认证服务中“匿名账号”服务，详细请参见开通认证服务。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "访问端侧网关的客户端需要具备有效的Client ID以及Client Secret，才能通过端侧网关的鉴权校验并对业务接口发起有效调用。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "登录HarmonyOS 开发者中心，进入“开发者管理”页面。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "左侧导航栏选择“ID、证书和Profile > APP ID”，选择“项目管理”页签。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "点开“项目”下拉列表，选择目标项目。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "记录“项目”栏下的“Client ID”和“Client Secret”。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取客户端API授权",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section18502104612500",
      "text": "调用获取Token接口，获取访问客户端REST API的Access Token。您在3中记录的“Client ID”和“Client Secret”将作为请求参数在调用时传入。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取Token",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section61082205110",
      "text": "您可使用客户端REST API调用获取Token接口，通过华为开放平台进行鉴权，并获取认证通过后的Token。"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取Token",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section61082205110",
      "text": "根据请求参数获取对应参数值，构造获取Token请求体。 POST /agc/apigw/oauth2/v1/token Host: connect-drcn.dbankcloud.cn Content-Type: application/json { \"useJwt\":\"1\", \"grant_type\":\"client_credentials\", \"client_id\":\"26********20\", \"client_secret\":\"************************\" }"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取Token",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-Guides/agc-clouddb-restapi-0000001518509166#section61082205110",
      "text": "POST /agc/apigw/oauth2/v1/token Host: connect-drcn.dbankcloud.cn Content-Type: application/json { \"useJwt\":\"1\", \"grant_type\":\"client_credentials\", \"client_id\":\"26********20\", \"client_secret\":\"************************\" }"
    },
